#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:5
#: 71b6b70a79a94a2892093542291837f7
msgid "Archived:Edge Quick Start"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:8
#: 356afecafaec4a9782ea5b56a05ffc58
msgid "This quickstart tutorial will guide you through the initial setup of Edge drone controller and its accessories. In the end you’ll get a configured Edge drone controller that streams video from a camera to your laptop. After that you can proceed to the hardware installation guide and install your Edge in a frame."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:18
#: 379f183754f346aaa52d26ac87101a6c
msgid "Please update Edge to the latest `firmware <https://docs.emlid.com/edge/firmware-update/>`__  before continuing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:22
#: 2a47ed7c3d7f49659019765503cafede
msgid "If you encounter any issues performing these steps, we are happy to help you out on our `community forum <http://community.emlid.com/>`__ ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:27
#: 84fcec2fe4a64adf8f0105818500cbc8
msgid "Connect Edge GNSS module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:29
#: 15eeefc3a169467686bb81c7d2db7a49
msgid "Edge GNSS module is a positioning device that contains a GNSS receiver, a high-precision barometer and two 3-axis compasses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:31
#: fc5f675bc3134b33b521e04f5e822f54
msgid "To connect Edge GNSS module to Edge use a JST-GH-4P to JST-GH-4P cable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:32
#: 852dd52a6baf43388de4662ba3725d51
msgid "Connect one end of the cable to any of the CAN ports on Edge GNSS module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:33
#: 1456c1327bdf48f1a4dc6c837d0fa61c
msgid "Connect another end of the cable to any of the CAN ports of Edge drone controller"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:41
#: 13753530a7de44b2b32be163c9b75c79
msgid "Connect video camera"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:43
#: 6b66b7b4072847e2944213476db511a2
msgid "Camera should be connected to the HDMI-IN port on Edge. In case you are connecting an action camera then most likely it will have Micro-HDMI connector as well. In that case you would need Micro-HDMI to Micro-HDMI cable to connect the camera to the Edge."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:50
#: 8c6ba6316550424f9046f4728d5fd2aa
msgid "Turn off the camera’s internal WiFi, otherwise it may interfere with RC equipment or Wi-Fi modules"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:53
#: d74071cd83dd453fb00b35a5571e1ced
msgid "Turn the camera on after Edge is `booted <https://docs.emlid.com/edge/led-status/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:56
#: 977a555a1ace4f418468bb6416176634
msgid "Resolution and frame per second value of the input stream may vary. Maximum supported video format is 1080p 30fps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:61
#: 619efe2a59b44cb897113470fb865c99
msgid "Connect Wi-Fi modules"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:63
#: bdbb43f779d6425583051277287674b9
msgid "Edge kit comes with two identical long-range Wi-Fi modules in separate boxes. Use one to connect to the Edge drone controller and another one to connect to a computer (assuming a laptop for rest of the guide)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:67
#: 4025a0dc40124c02ab3eb6e95820c424
msgid "Connect Wi-Fi module to Edge"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:72
#: f9167a480dc844aea92d3caa9b209874
msgid "To connect Wi-Fi module to the Edge use a Micro-USB to JSH-GH-4P cable from the kit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:74
#: 46365fa546434cc7879ef3b6b6fa76bd
msgid "Plug JST-GH-4P connector into Edge port labeled USB2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:75
#: aaedf73597464fae987c51b7cae9306c
msgid "Plug Micro-USB connector into Micro-USB port of the Wi-Fi module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:79
#: 44b4fb0484f1415c82b03ade03561db8
msgid "Connect Wi-Fi module to a computer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:85
#: d6a2deb9e03b4270b77a336aa749c2aa
msgid "We need to connect another Wi-Fi module to the laptop. In order to do that you need to perform two simple steps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:87
#: 17a9acc0d2a94a3f82b91521e6e1f441
msgid "Use Alfa’s Micro-USB-3.0 to USB-3.0 cable from the Wi-Fi module box"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:89
#: ec87075ce6ff4d439c35c56447ebf415
msgid "Connect Micro-USB-3.0 one end of the cable to the Wi-Fi module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:90
#: 33791abcdb2d4c44b2756889e449fb7a
msgid "Connect the other end to the USB port of your laptop/desktop computer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:94
#: cca9a09e52654aada5be4d0233cc7324
msgid "Software installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:96
#: db45dd7b2ee940e6b6011b67de0414b7
msgid "Now we need to install the driver for the Wi-Fi module. The instructions depend on your OS. Please, proceed to the `<https://docs.emlid.com/edge/quickstart/#software-installation>`__ for the detailed instructions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:102
#: f62e828deb2247269af934a55ceedfd4
msgid "Power from a battery"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:104
#: 2a2b029b51ac4c0e877767c355068b77
msgid "Now you can turn on your Edge using the Edge Power Module (PM)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:106
#: 317c06afcd924626a0b910e724e42311
msgid "Connect JST-GH-6P connector to any power port on Edge (PWR1 or PWR2)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:111
#: 673e477e6f1d4ccdbbb98768ab685b55
msgid "And after that connect a battery to your PM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:119
#: cff7b5a4d6884eeb9f2f79ab90bbe370
msgid "Connect to Edge’s access point"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:121
#: b30136a3d11e40caa275f4e5c440f0ea
msgid "After powering up Edge needs some time to create an access point (AP). Connect to Edge’s AP (edge) with password: EmlidEdge (since 1.2 the password will be emlidedge)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:124
#: 51179f63332a4cab9fbf1edcb25d3045
msgid "Most laptops have a built-in Wi-Fi module. You need to connect to Edge using specifically the external Wi-Fi module provided with Edge."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:131
#: 44dde54b2a6b44cbbdb230a5ca8ceabe
msgid "To avoid interference from the internal Wi-Fi we recommend disabling it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:134
#: 5c8c643b852f4af7863b32fa0b356aae
msgid "Be sure you connect to AP using the external Wi-Fi module, not the built-in Wi-Fi module of your laptop After the connection succeeded you can run the QGC."
msgstr ""

